OL,4,CTwo men dead in glider crash         W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GTwo men have died after a glider     W5
OL,7,Gcrashed into Loch Leven.             W5
OL,8,                                      W5
OL,9,GPolice, ambulance, fire service and  W5
OL,10,Gthe coastguard were called to the    W5
OL,11,Gscene near Kinross at about 11:00.   W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GThe Scottish Gliding Centre, which   W5
OL,14,Gis based at Portmoak Airfield near   W5
OL,15,Gthe loch, said a two-seater Perkoz   W5
OL,16,Gaircraft had "crashed whilst on a    W5
OL,17,Glocal training flight" but it was    W5
OL,18,Gnot clear what had caused the crash. W5
